Definition list as a first-class block opener

```
- one
  :: term
  :  def
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>def</dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- one
:: term
:  def
.
<ul>
  <li>one</li>
</ul>
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>def</dd>
</dl>
```

```
- one
 :: term
 :  def
.
<ul>
  <li>one
:: term
:  def</li>
</ul>
```

```
- one

  :: t
  :  d
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
      <dd>d</dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```
